  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nCall or Text Us: (310) 954-9449\n\nRequest An Appointment\n\nPatient Registration\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Team\n\nDr. Jonathan Shadi\n\nDr. Saman Vahedi\n\nOur Technology\n\nCone Beam 3D Imaging\n\nProcedures\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone Grafting\n\nPre-Prosthetic Surgery\n\nPlatelet Rich Fibrin (PRF)\n\nOral Pathology\n\nOrthognathic (Corrective Jaw) Surgery\n\nDental Implants\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nImpacted Canines\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nFacial Trauma Fractures\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPatient Center\n\nPatient Information\n\nInsurance & Finance\n\nAreas We Serve\n\nMar Vista\n\nPalms\n\nCulver City\n\nWestwood\n\nSawtelle\n\nCentury City\n\nBrentwood\n\nSanta Monica\n\nWest Los Angeles\n\nSurgical Instructions\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nOral Surgery Pre-Operative Instructions\n\nPost-Operative Instructions\n\nReferring Doctors\n\nBlogs\n\nContact Us\n\n\n# Reviews\n\n\n\n## Wilshire Oral Surgery and Implant Center Reviews\n\n\nRead what our clients say about our office and patient care. We’re proud of our 5 star reviews and the reputation we’ve established in the community.\n\nDr Vahedi was great. I had my two sons have their wisdom teeth removed. Both sons 17 and 21 had minor pain after the surgery. Very professional and answered all ur questions. Highly recommend. The staff Stephanie and Andria I think were fantastic, very helpful and answered all ur questions.​​​​​​​\n\n​​​​​​​By David D.​​​​​​​\n\nDr. Vahedi removed my 8-year old’s supernumerary tooth yesterday, and so far we are very pleased with the result and the overall process. All the staff were very professional, from the front desk to the nurses to Dr. Vahedi. They helped my daughter feel comfortable in what would otherwise be a very stressful process for a child. Thank you!​​​​​​​\n\n​​​​​​​By Rebecca C.​​​​​​​\n\nI was given a referral from my dentist to see Dr. Shadi. I didn’t know what to expect at first because of where his office was, 23 miles from my home. I was reluctant at first because of the travel distance but after meeting the office and Dr. Shadi for the first time, I had no second thoughts and scheduled my appointment for an Implant. Both the staff and Doctor were very professional. The implant was a success with zero complications. I would truly recommend Wilshire Oral Surgery for your dental needs. Thank you Doc!\n\n​​​​​​​By John E.​​​​​​​\n\nEverything was explained. All treatment options. What to expect during procedure and recovery. Staff very helpful. Very clean and modern offices. I would highly recommend​​​​​​​\n\n​​​​​​​By Brian B.​​​​​​​\n\nThe office gave my daughter an appointment with within a very reasonable time. On day of appointment they saw her on time, explained the procedure and after are in detail. All staff including the dentist were extremely empathetic and supportive of my daughter. Surgeon personally called and followed up with us after she had her wisdom teeth pulled. Everyone was extremely sweet and compassionate to our needs. Will recommend this office to others.​​​​​​​\n\n​​​​​​​By Vanessa G. ​​​​​​\n\nHad all of my wisdom teeth extracted at once here. The cost was affordable (compared to competitors) and the surgery was only around 30 minutes. I opted for PRF which greatly helped the healing process – I healed in about 4-5 days. Can’t recommend them enough, they have such a friendly group of office staff and surgeons.​​​​​​​\n\n​​​​​​​By Sabrina C.​​​​​​​\n\n\n## Write a Review\n\n\nWe value your opinion!\n\nPlease use the form below to submit a review of our practice. ​​​​​​​Keep in mind others come to our site to research brands before they make a purchase. Helpful reviews are factually correct, detailed and give a good understanding of what your experience was like from start to finish.​​​​​​​​​​​​​\n\nName\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\n\n### Contact Information\n\n\n12300 Wilshire Blvd #326 Los Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 954-9449\n\n\n### Hours of Operation\n\n\nMonday\n\n8:00am – 4:00pm\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nClosed\n\nSunday\n\n© 2026 Wilshire Oral Surgery and Implant Center. All Rights Reserved.\n\nAccessibility Statement\n\nMEET US\n\nSurgical Instructio...\n\nBlog\n\nMeet Us\n\nPatient Registration Form\n\nPre-prosthetic Surgery\n\nOral Surgery Pre-operative Instructions\n\nIV Sedation / General Anesthesia\n\nPost-operative Instructions",
